# Keep the build context small and keep secrets/artifacts out of images.
# Both Dockerfiles use this file (the frontend builds from the repo root).

.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
apps/frontend/dist

# Secrets — never copy a real .env into an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Test corpora, baselines and benchmark output: hundreds of PNGs the runtime
# image has no use for.
apps/backend/tests
apps/backend/data
docs/benchmarks
tools

# Docs
*.md
!README.md
